Drop local image/video files here to use them without an external host.

Vite (dev) and Vercel/Netlify (prod) both serve this folder at /media/, same
origin as the app, with HTTP range support -- so video seeking works.

Reference them by a site-root path when creating media:

  /media/clip.mp4

Stored that way the same row works everywhere: the browser resolves the path
against whatever origin the page is on, so there is no localhost-vs-deployed
URL to keep in step.

Keep files small (a few MB); they are committed to git and shipped in the
frontend deploy.
